291	
292	    /* ⭐⭐ A SCOPE REFUSAL IS NOT A SERVER FAULT AND MUST NOT WEAR ONE.
293	     *
294	     * 502 says *something went wrong*. This went RIGHT: the author set a
295	     * latitude, MAIA exceeded it, and the system held the line. 409 says
296	     * *refused, and here is why* — with the counts, so the writer learns which
297	     * control to move instead of being handed a screen of their own words
